{"title": "Arachnohead", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Arachnohead</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:ArachnoheadGame.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"ArachnoheadGame.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/ArachnoheadGame.jpg/250px-ArachnoheadGame.jpg?d7a0cf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ArachnoheadGame.jpg/375px-ArachnoheadGame.jpg?d7a0cf 1.5x, /images/thumb/ArachnoheadGame.jpg/500px-ArachnoheadGame.jpg?d7a0cf 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nBunker Spider</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nArachnoheadEnemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nBlast, Mauling</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n50, 90, or Instant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.15</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Arachnohead</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Bunker_Spider\">Bunker Spider</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is a pale, baby doll-like head attached to four mechanical legs. It has a right blue eye and a left green eye that emit a light and are constantly shfiting focus.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to a Bunker Spider, an <b>Arachnohead</b> will initially attempt to create a nesting area by placing several webs in the surrounding area and will typically stop if it encounters a player until line of sight is broken. Once all the webs have been laid down, the <b>Arachnohead</b> will find a spot to wait until one of its webs is triggered, a player walks underneath it, or it is attacked by a player. It will then pursue that player.\n</p><p>If the head of an <b>Arachnohead</b> comes into contact with players, they will take 90 damage. Any player that dies to an <b>Arachnohead</b> in this way will be cocooned, hung from the ceiling, and only be recoverable via the teleporter.\n</p><p>The <b>Arachnohead</b> additionally explodes on death. This explosion deals 50 damage to all nearby players or kills players and entities very close to the explosion. This explosion can set off nearby landmines, set off other <b>Arachnoheads</b>, and set Forest Keepers on fire.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>An <b>Arachnohead</b> is guaranteed to spawn after triggering a <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios#Teddy_Bears\" title=\"Filitrios\">Teddy Bear on Filitrios</a>. The <b>Arachnohead</b> is also injected into the <b>Enemy Spawns (Interior)</b> table of any moon experiencing <a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Hallowed\" title=\"Weathers\"><b>Hallowed</b></a> weather with a weight of 35, overriding the current weight if it is lower than that.\n</p><p>The <b>Arachnohead</b> can also naturally spawn on the following moons:\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Moon Name</th>\n<th>Interior or Exterior</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gratar\" title=\"Gratar\">Gratar</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>5.44%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Carnate\" title=\"Carnate\">Carnate</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>3.86%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\">Hyx</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>2.51%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\">Gloom</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>2.13%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\">Filitrios</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.69%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Arachnohead <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">ARACHNOHEAD<br /><br />Sigurd's danger level: 35%<br /><br />Scientific name: Areck-hetoma<br />Areck-hetoma or the \u201cArachnohead\u201d are vicious devices designed to ensnare their targets with the intent to kill.<br />It is theorised their original intended purpose was to act as a security device and scare off intruders when spotted. However it is certain their current purpose is to only act as a trap, an artefact of the war predating the quiet age.<br /><br />Their appearance is that of a teddy bear with a head resembling that of a baby doll. The teddy bear exterior is only there to conceal the machinery of the Arachnohead itself in its dormant state. Upon activation it starts a search for any nearby entities internally listed as enemy targets. When a target is spotted it leaves its teddy enclosure and uses a set of four hydraulic legs to chase its target.<br />The internals of the head are often very haphazardly wired and it is not uncommon for the wrong wires to cross during an impact of blunt force causing a short circuit leading to a possibly explosive reaction. While it is a flaw in the original design, it was never resolved due to it being a very favourable feature when used in times of conflict.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Walking</b></td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"11\" data-mwtitle=\"ArachnoheadWalking.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/ArachnoheadWalking.mp3?d42d04\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/ArachnoheadWalking.mp3/ArachnoheadWalking.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Attacking</b></td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"ArachnoheadAttack.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/ArachnoheadAttack.mp3?4cfc07\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/ArachnoheadAttack.mp3/ArachnoheadAttack.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Getting Hit</b></td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"ArachnoheadHit.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/ArachnoheadHit.mp3?7a40ac\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/ArachnoheadHit.mp3/ArachnoheadHit.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Death</b></td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"7\" data-mwtitle=\"ArachnoheadDeathExplosion.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/ArachnoheadDeathExplosion.mp3?e45e2b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/ArachnoheadDeathExplosion.mp3/ArachnoheadDeathExplosion.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Teddy Bear Searching</b></td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"18\" data-mwtitle=\"TeddySearch.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/TeddySearch.mp3?946f51\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/TeddySearch.mp3/TeddySearch.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The corpse of the Arachnohead.\"><img alt=\"The corpse of the Arachnohead.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg/120px-ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg?a3a618\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg/180px-ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg?a3a618 1.5x, /images/thumb/ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg/240px-ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg?a3a618 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The corpse of the Arachnohead.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["ArachnoheadGame.jpg", "ArachnoheadCorpse.jpg", "ArachnoheadWalking.mp3", "ArachnoheadAttack.mp3", "ArachnoheadHit.mp3", "ArachnoheadDeathExplosion.mp3", "TeddySearch.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}